# ─── Shega Mobile environment ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy to `.env` (Expo reads it automatically) and adjust per environment.
#
# Shega account / onboarding / subscription / payment backend. Mobile, Desktop
# and Admin must all point at the SAME backend so an account shares one
# subscription and one business id across platforms.
#
# Resolution order in the app:
#   1. EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL (this file / the EAS build environment)
#   2. `expo.extra.apiUrl` in app.json
#   3. the built-in public testing endpoint
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://your-shega-backend.example.com
